{"seq":4,"slug":"first-conversation","title":"第一次对话","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-handbook/foundations/first-conversation","wordCount":828,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"第一次对话\">第一次对话</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本节把前三节的骨架、SDK、Provider 串成一条可运行的端到端链路：用户在浏览器输入消息，前端把消息数组 POST 给 Hono 路由，路由经 <code>getModel()</code> 取到模型实例、调用 <code>generateText</code> 生成回复，再把结果返回前端渲染。</p>\n<p>这条链路的每个环节都对应前文的一个构件——Hono 提供 API 层，<code>generateText</code> 提供一次性生成能力，Provider 注册表提供模型选择。串起来之后，你得到的是一个真正能用 curl 和浏览器验证的最小 Agent；后续章节的流式、工具调用、Agent 循环，都是在这条链路上逐层替换与增强。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>载体</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输入</td>\n<td>React 前端</td>\n<td>构建 messages 数组并发起 fetch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路由</td>\n<td>Hono <code>/api/chat</code></td>\n<td>解析请求、调用模型、封装响应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型</td>\n<td><code>getModel()</code> + <code>generateText</code></td>\n<td>按 modelId 选择 Provider 并生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出</td>\n<td>JSON 响应</td>\n<td>返回 assistant 内容与 usage</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>先跑通端到端、再逐步替换单点，是本手册一贯的推进方式：任何新能力都放进一条已经能跑的最小链路里验证，而不是一次性搭好全部抽象。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"目标\">目标</h2><p>本节将前三节的所有准备工作串联起来，实现一个完整的对话链路：用户通过 HTTP 请求或浏览器界面发送消息，Agent 服务调用大模型生成回复，前端展示结果。完成后，你将拥有一个可运行的端到端对话系统。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant User as 用户&#10;    participant Web as React 前端&#10;    participant API as Hono API&#10;    participant LLM as 大模型&#10;&#10;    User-&gt;&gt;Web: 输入消息&#10;    Web-&gt;&gt;API: POST /api/chat&#10;    API-&gt;&gt;LLM: generateText()&#10;    LLM--&gt;&gt;API: 生成结果&#10;    API--&gt;&gt;Web: JSON 响应&#10;    Web--&gt;&gt;User: 显示回复\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户\n    participant Web as React 前端\n    participant API as Hono API\n    participant LLM as 大模型\n\n    User-&gt;&gt;Web: 输入消息\n    Web-&gt;&gt;API: POST /api/chat\n    API-&gt;&gt;LLM: generateText()\n    LLM--&gt;&gt;API: 生成结果\n    API--&gt;&gt;Web: JSON 响应\n    Web--&gt;&gt;User: 显示回复</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"第一步-创建聊天路由\">第一步：创建聊天路由</h2><p>在 <code>agent/src/routes/</code> 下创建 <code>chat.ts</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { Hono } from &#39;hono&#39;;&#10;import { generateText } from &#39;ai&#39;;&#10;import { getModel } from &#39;../providers/index.js&#39;;&#10;&#10;const chat = new Hono();&#10;&#10;chat.post(&#39;/api/chat&#39;, async (c) =&gt; {&#10;  const { messages, model: modelId = &#39;gpt-5&#39; } = await c.req.json();&#10;&#10;  const { text, usage } = await generateText({&#10;    model: getModel(modelId),&#10;    system: &#39;你是一个友好的 AI 助手，用中文回答问题。&#39;,&#10;    messages,&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return c.json({&#10;    role: &#39;assistant&#39;,&#10;    content: text,&#10;    usage,&#10;  });&#10;});&#10;&#10;export default chat;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Hono } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hono'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { generateText } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ai'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { getModel } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '../providers/index.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> chat</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Hono</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">chat.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">post</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/chat'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">messages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">model</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">modelId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'gpt-5'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.req.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">usage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generateText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(modelId),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    system: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'你是一个友好的 AI 助手，用中文回答问题。'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    messages,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    role: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'assistant'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    content: text,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    usage,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chat;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"第二步-注册路由\">第二步：注册路由</h2><p>在 <code>agent/src/index.ts</code> 中挂载聊天路由：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { serve } from &#39;@hono/node-server&#39;;&#10;import { Hono } from &#39;hono&#39;;&#10;import { cors } from &#39;hono/cors&#39;;&#10;import chat from &#39;./routes/chat.js&#39;;&#10;&#10;const app = new Hono();&#10;&#10;app.use(&#39;/*&#39;, cors({ origin: &#39;http://localhost:5173&#39; }));&#10;app.get(&#39;/health&#39;, (c) =&gt; c.json({ status: &#39;ok&#39; }));&#10;app.route(&#39;/&#39;, chat);&#10;&#10;serve({ fetch: app.fetch, port: 3000 }, (info) =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(`Agent server running on http://localhost:${info.port}`);&#10;});&#10;&#10;export default app;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { serve } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@hono/node-server'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Hono } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hono'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { cors } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hono/cors'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chat </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './routes/chat.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> app</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Hono</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">app.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">use</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\